{"seq":88,"slug":"game-spatial-data-structures","title":"游戏空间数据结构","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures","rating":{"composite":3.97,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"游戏空间数据结构-碰撞检测与场景管理的算法基础\">游戏空间数据结构：碰撞检测与场景管理的算法基础</h1><p>游戏引擎每帧都要回答同一类问题：哪些物体靠近玩家？摄像机能看见哪些物体？子弹打中了什么？朴素地遍历场景中所有对象，代价是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——对于拥有数千个动态实体的现代游戏而言完全不可行。<strong>空间数据结构</strong>将这些查询的复杂度降至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 甚至接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，是游戏性能优化的最核心基础。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦游戏引擎中实际使用的空间加速结构：从经典的四叉树、八叉树、BSP 树，到工业级的 BVH 与 GPU 加速变体，系统讲解构建、查询与动态更新三大工程问题。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-的定位与边界\">本 Hub 的定位与边界</h2><p>本 hub 专门讲解<strong>空间数据结构本身</strong>——它们的构建算法、查询机制、动态维护策略，以及在游戏引擎中的适用场景。</p>\n<p>与相邻 hub 的边界如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>相邻 Hub</th>\n<th>与本 Hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>game-physics</td>\n<td>使用本 hub 提供的 broad-phase 结构（BVH、AABB 树）作为输入，本 hub 不讲约束求解、刚体动力学</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>game-performance-optimization</td>\n<td>本 hub 是其重要子集；渲染线程优化、DrawCall 合并等不在本 hub 讨论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pathfinding-navigation-mesh</td>\n<td>NavMesh 是空间数据结构的应用层；路径搜索算法（A*、Dijkstra）超出本 hub 范围</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[1. 基础结构] --&gt; B[2. 包围体层次]&#10;    A --&gt; C[3. 查询与剔除]&#10;    B --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; D[4. 高级技术]&#10;    B --&gt; D\">graph LR\n    A[1. 基础结构] --&gt; B[2. 包围体层次]\n    A --&gt; C[3. 查询与剔除]\n    B --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; D[4. 高级技术]\n    B --&gt; D</pre><p>建议学习顺序：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>第 1 章：基础结构</strong>——空间哈希、四叉树/八叉树、BSP 树，掌握分治空间的三种基本思路</li>\n<li><strong>第 2 章：包围体层次</strong>——BVH 是现代游戏引擎的核心结构，包括构建、遍历、动态更新</li>\n<li><strong>第 3 章：查询与剔除</strong>——视锥剔除、遮挡剔除、范围查询，直接影响每帧渲染代价</li>\n<li><strong>第 4 章：高级技术</strong>——松散八叉树、R-Tree/KD-Tree、GPU 加速，工程进阶</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>学习本 hub 需要具备以下基础：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>线性代数基础</strong>：向量、矩阵乘法、点积与叉积</li>\n<li><strong>基础数据结构</strong>：树、哈希表、优先队列</li>\n<li><strong>Big-O 分析</strong>：理解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的差异</li>\n<li><strong>3D 坐标系</strong>：理解世界空间、局部空间的概念</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念速览\">核心概念速览</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>典型查询复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>动态友好度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>空间哈希</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 平均</td>\n<td>均匀分布的大量小对象</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>四叉树/八叉树</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>非均匀分布、LOD 管理</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BSP 树</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>静态几何、可见性排序</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BVH</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>通用碰撞检测、光线追踪</td>\n<td>高（refit）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KD-Tree</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>静态点云最近邻</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>R-Tree</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>大规模静态地图查询</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 中的 BVH 构建技术是现代光线追踪加速的核心，可参考 GPU 光线追踪相关资料深入</li>\n<li>游戏物理引擎（Bullet、PhysX、Jolt）的 broad phase 实现是本 hub 理论的工程落地参考</li>\n<li>Erin Catto 的 GDC 讲座系列（Box2D / Box3D 宽相实现）是优质工程参考</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"第一章：基础空间分割结构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"spatial-hashing","title":"空间哈希与均匀网格：游戏中的 $O(1)$ 空间查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/foundations/spatial-hashing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"quadtree-octree","title":"四叉树与八叉树：自适应空间细分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/foundations/quadtree-octree"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bsp-trees","title":"BSP 树与空间二分：游戏历史中最重要的空间结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/foundations/bsp-trees"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"bounding-volumes","title":"第二章：包围体层次结构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/bounding-volumes","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bvh-construction","title":"BVH 构建与遍历：游戏引擎碰撞检测的核心结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/bounding-volumes/bvh-construction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"aabb-obb-spheres","title":"AABB、OBB 与包围球：游戏碰撞检测的几何基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/bounding-volumes/aabb-obb-spheres"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dynamic-bvh-updates","title":"动态 BVH 更新策略：游戏物理的实时维护挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/bounding-volumes/dynamic-bvh-updates"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"query-culling","title":"第三章：空间查询与视图剔除","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/query-culling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"frustum-culling","title":"视锥剔除：减少 GPU 渲染工作量的第一道关卡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/query-culling/frustum-culling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"occlusion-culling","title":"遮挡剔除：消除被遮挡的无效渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/query-culling/occlusion-culling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"range-nearest-queries","title":"范围查询与最近邻：游戏 AI、物理与音效的空间感知基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/query-culling/range-nearest-queries"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"advanced-techniques","title":"第四章：高级空间加速技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/advanced-techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"loose-octree-lod","title":"松散八叉树与 LOD：解决大对象的空间管理难题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/advanced-techniques/loose-octree-lod"},{"seq":2,"slug":"r-tree-kd-tree","title":"R-Tree 与 KD-Tree：大规模静态空间数据的专用索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/advanced-techniques/r-tree-kd-tree"},{"seq":3,"slug":"gpu-spatial-acceleration","title":"GPU 空间加速结构：并行硬件重塑碰撞与光线追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/advanced-techniques/gpu-spatial-acceleration"}]}]}